flowchart TD
  SLOT[Declared scalar local slot] --> FLAGS{Address taken or volatile}
  FLAGS -->|Yes| RETAIN[Retain local memory operations and guards]
  FLAGS -->|No| STATES[Compute possible alive and retired states across CFG]
  STATES --> CHECK{Access or reset may follow retirement}
  CHECK -->|Yes| RETAIN
  CHECK -->|No| VALUE{Stored value may be indeterminate}
  VALUE -->|Yes| RETAIN
  VALUE -->|No| PHIS[Insert dominance-frontier phis for eligible slot]
  PHIS --> RENAME[Rename local operations and only newly inserted phis]
  RENAME --> READ[Retain undef read behavior through SSA definitions]
  READ --> VERIFY[Verify and compare independent classifications]
  VERIFY --> AGAIN[Second promotion preserves canonical bytes]
